<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss franc ends firmer.</title>
<headline>Swiss franc ends firmer.</headline>
<text>
<p>1535 GMT - The Swiss franc closed firmer despite intra-day gains by the dollar. Mark/Swiss also slipped.</p>
<p>* Dollar ends at 1.2670/2680 Swiss francs vs opening 1.2646/2656 and Wednesday close at 1.2680/2690. Traders said they expected market to continue testing 1.2680, with good support at 1.2635.</p>
<p>* Mark closes at 84.47/50 centimes vs opening 84.63/66 and 84.58/59 at prior close. Range seen at 84.40/65.</p>
<p>* Three-month eurofrancs 1.86/98 percent vs 1.75/2.00 late on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
